{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22194","headline":"题浔阳楼 · 白居易","name":"题浔阳楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱陶彭泽，文思何高玄。\n又怪韦江州，诗情亦清闲。\n今朝登此楼，有以知其然。\n大江寒见底，匡山青倚天。\n深夜湓浦月，平旦鑪峰烟。\n清辉与灵气，日夕供文篇。\n我无二人才，孰爲来其间。\n因高偶成句，俯仰媿江山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}